cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CARE-ASD: An Identifiability Audit of Contaminated-Reference Processing for Anomalous Sound Detection"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-06"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CARE-ASD Research Contributors"
abstract: >-
  CARE-ASD provides frozen, reproducible audits of contaminated-reference
  processing for unsupervised anomalous sound detection. It retains harmful and
  null outcomes, known-component safety checks, and preregistered stop decisions.
keywords:
  - anomalous sound detection
  - acoustic path
  - reliability calibration
  - DCASE
  - machine condition monitoring
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NADUNGVN/care-asd"
